Error [E0119]: `decode` expects exactly one type argument, got 2
  --> tests/ui/generic_decode_type_arity.jet:4:19
    |
  4 |     value :: json.decode<Int, String>("1")
    |                   ^^^^^^
 Why: A typed decode call needs one target type
 Fix: Write `decode<Target>(...)` with one target type
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0119
